            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Liz Dalton 'Lizzie'"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Good basic Enchilada recipe, but I knew we would not care for this as written, so I made some changes. I used real chicken breast sauteed and shredded, I used enchilada sauce in place of just tomato sauce, I omitted the Romano cheese, and after everything was assembled, I put cheese on top and broiled for 3 minutes to melt the cheese. I topped with guacamole too!",
